    "detailed_description": "An action game to rescue a cat from the forest.<br />\r\nFind lost cats in the forest and bring them home!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are various and numerous cats hidden in the forest.<br />\r\nThe kittens lost their way out of curiosity about outside the house!<br />\r\nThe villain cat that disturbs the hero cat!<br />\r\nScary ghost cat that appears only at night!<br />\r\nA giant cat that's bigger than other cats!<br />\r\nAll these cats start following you as soon as they run into you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA variety of fun and interesting stages.<br />\r\nTo avoid obstacles and open a closed door, <br />\r\nyou must press the switch with a moving box.<br />\r\nYou need a fish sword to defeat the villain cats who are after you.<br />\r\nBe careful not to fall when crossing a single-wood bridge.<br />\r\nGhost cats follow you when they don't make eye contact with you.<br />\r\nBe careful not to show your back.<br />\r\nTo overcome these difficulties, quick control and concentration are required.<br />\r\nHowever, it is an action arcade game that is not difficult and easy for anyone to play.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFall for the cats that follow you around.<br />\r\nAnd look for hidden stages, too.",
